  "details": "Highlighting someone and clicking View Avatar Details, then half a second later closing the main menu will still open the avatar details menu.\nThe menu works fine other than missing the main menu behind it, but clicking View Author will open the main menu with missing elements.\nPretty easy to repo once you've got the timing down.\n\nAttached a video to better show the issue:\nhttps://youtu.be/cVy92udCE3w",
